      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This also happens to me when playing it through Steam Link VR on my Quest 2. The game works perfectly fine in desktop and my Quest itself can handle it perfectly fine on the app. Oftenly it can't even load the content of the worlds I'm trying to load into and will disconnect there as well. Sometimes I'm lucky enough for it to work for a few minutes but later disconnects again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
