  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-10T13:45:41.257Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Ever since I've started using Steam Link instead of wired PCVR, I have experienced disconnects which very rarely occurred while using the latter.\n\nDisconnects happen more often in public instances or instances with many users, but have also happened when alone.\n\nI have noticed two different kinds of disconnects:\n\n- Classic disconnect where you rejoin the same instance after reconnecting,\n\n- Disconnect where after a long time staring at the instance loading screen (2~ minutes), it goes dark for a few seconds and then loads you into a \"Friends\" instance of the same world. This also happens if you are disconnected from a \"Friends\" instance, you are reloaded into another one with you as the instance master.\n\nThis never happens when using wired SteamVR or Quest Standalone, despite being on the same network.\n\nThis also doesn't happen when playing other VR games through Steam Link.",
